{"sections":[{"slug":"谷山–志村猜想","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"谷山–志村猜想"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">谷山</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">志村猜想</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“谷山–志村猜想”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">谷山</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">志村猜想的大意是说每个有理</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">都来自</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模形式</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">表述</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbb{Q}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的椭圆曲线都可由某个级数</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">的经典模曲线</span> $X_0(N)$ <span lang=\"zh\">经过一个整系数的有理映射得到</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">级的模参数化</span> (modular parametrization).</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意有理椭圆曲线</span> $y^2= Ax^3 + Bx^2+ Cx+ D$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">级的非常值模函数</span> $f(z),g(z)$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $f(z)^2 = A g(z)^2 + C g(z) + D$ (<span lang=\"zh\">也即有同样的</span> Dirichlet L-<span lang=\"zh\">级数</span>).</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">设有理椭圆曲线</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">有导子</span> $N_E$, <span lang=\"zh\">则存在尖点形式</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $a_1(f)=1$, <span lang=\"zh\">且对所有素数</span> $p$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $a_p(f)=a_p(E)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应的关系</span></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Taniyama conjecture says that the L-series of an elliptic curve over Q is automorphic (more specifically, arises from a modular form). Langlands conjectures that every L-series arising from algebraic geometry is automorphic (in the sense he defined).</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Langlands对应","text":"Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}